msgid "<b>ABOUT US</b>"
msgstr "<b>ABOUT US</b>"

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_27
msgid ""
"<b>Architectural Excellence:</b> A modern duplex layout that maximizes both "
"privacy and social space."
msgstr ""
"<b>Keunggulan Arsitektur:</b> Layout dupleks modern yang memaksimalkan "
"privasi dan ruang sosial."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_27
msgid ""
"<b>Breathtaking Views:</b> Wide-angle vistas of the Uccle skyline from your "
"private balcony."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pemandangan Menakjubkan:</b> Pemandangan cakrawala Uccle yang luas dari "
"balkon privat."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>CRM App</b>: Manage your leads efficiently, tracking ongoing buying and "
"selling opportunities in a visual\n"
"                pipeline."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi CRM</b>: Kelola lead Anda dengan efisien, lacak peluang "
"pembelian dan penjualan dalam bentuk\n"
"                pipeline visual."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Contacts App: </b>Centralize all stakeholder data, managing the unique "
"relationships between property owners,\n"
"                tenants, and service providers within a single, searchable "
"directory with full communication history."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Kontak: </b>Pusatkan semua data pemangku kepentingan, kelola "
"hubungan khusus antara pemilik properti,\n"
"                penyewa, dan penyedia layanan dalam satu direktori yang "
"dapat dicari dengan riwayat komunikasi lengkap."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_20
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_21
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_22
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_26
msgid "<b>Contemporary Heritage Living</b>"
msgstr "<b>Kehidupan Warisan Kontemporer</b>"

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Create a Contract:</b> Click \"New\" and select the tenant as the "
"\"Customer\" and add the Rental fee product."
msgstr ""
"<b>Buat Kontrak:</b> Klik \"Baru\" dan pilih penyewa sebagai \"Pelanggan\", "
"lalu tambahkan produk Biaya Sewa."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Create a Property:</b> Click \"New\" to create a unit. Fill in its "
"building, location and other details."
msgstr ""
"<b>Buat Properti:</b> Klik \"Baru\" untuk membuat unit. Isi detail gedung, "
"lokasi, dan detail lainnya."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_20
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_21
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_22
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_26
msgid ""
"<b>Designer Interiors:</b> Each unit features unique, modern furniture "
"packages and high-quality flooring."
msgstr ""
"<b>Desainer Interior:</b> Setiap unit dilengkapi dengan paket furnitur "
"modern unik dan ubin lantai berkualitas tinggi."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_23
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_24
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_25
msgid ""
"<b>Diverse Space Options:</b> Whether you need a collaborative hub "
"(<b>Office M</b>), a focused executive suite (<b>Office S</b>), or a "
"spacious flagship floor (<b>Office T</b>), we have the right fit for your "
"team."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ragam Pilihan Ruang:</b> Dari pusat kolaborasi (<b>Kantor M</b>), ruang "
"eksekutif yang tenang (<b>Kantor S</b>), sampai lantai andalan yang luas (<b>"
"Kantor T</b>), kami memiliki pilihan yang tepat untuk tim Anda."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Documents App:</b> Store signed leases, property deeds, and insurance "
"certificates with expiration alerts."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Dokumen:</b> Simpan kontrak sewa yang sudah ditandatangani, akta "
"properti, dan sertifikat asuransi dengan pemberitahuan kedaluwarsa."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_23
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_24
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_25
msgid ""
"<b>Elite Location:</b> Situated in the prestigious <b>Louise area</b>, "
"providing immediate access to world-class dining, high-end retail, and "
"excellent transport links."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lokasi Elite:</b> Terletak di kawasan bergengsi <b>Louise</b>, yang "
"menawarkan akses langsung ke tempat bersantap kelas dunia, pusat "
"perbelanjaan mewah, dan jaringan transportasi yang sangat baik."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_23
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_24
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_25
msgid ""
"<b>Fully Equipped Amenities:</b> Access to premium lounges, designer meeting "
"rooms, and state-of-the-art infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fasilitas Lengkap:</b> Akses ke lounge premium, ruangan meeting desainer, "
"dan infrastruktur mutakhir."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_20
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_21
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_22
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_23
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_24
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_25
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_26
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_27
msgid "<b>Key Highlights:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Poin Utama:</b>"

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_23
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_24
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_25
msgid ""
"<b>Modern Industrial Aesthetic:</b> Features high ceilings, exposed "
"ductwork, and abundant natural light to foster creativity and productivity."
msgstr ""
"<b>Estetika Industrial Modern:</b> Dengan langit-langit tinggi, saluran "
"udara terbuka, dan cahaya alami yang melimpah untuk mendorong kreativitas "
"dan produktivitas."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Move-in Logs:</b> Utilize the dedicated property tab to record meter "
"readings (water, electricity) at the time of the tenant's entry and exit to "
"ensure accurate utility re-billing later."
msgstr ""
"<b>Log Masuk:</b> Gunakan tab properti khusus untuk mencatat pembacaan "
"meteran (air, listrik) pada saat penyewa masuk dan keluar guna memastikan "
"penagihan ulang utilitas yang akurat di kemudian hari."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Open the Availability</b>: Open the <strong>Leasing App</strong> and "
"navigate through the app menu Availability"
msgstr ""
"<b>Buka Ketersediaan</b>: Buka <strong>Aplikasi Penyewaan</strong> dan pergi "
"ke menu aplikasi Ketersediaan"

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Open the Contracts</b>: Open the <strong>Leasing App</strong> to reach "
"the Subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Buka Kontrak</b>: Buka <strong>Aplikasi Penyewaan</strong> untuk "
"mengakses Langganan."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Open the Properties: </b>Open the <b>Leasing App </b>and navigate through "
"the app menu Infrastructure / Properties."
msgstr ""
"<b>Buka Properti: </b>Buka <b>Aplikasi Penyewaan</b>dan pergi ke menu "
"aplikasi Infrastruktur / Properti."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_20
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_21
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_22
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_26
msgid ""
"<b>Peaceful Setting:</b> Set within the quiet, green surroundings of a "
"beautifully repurposed farmhouse."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lingkungan yang Tenang:</b> Berlatar di lingkungan yang tenang dan hijau "
"dari rumah ladang yang telah direnovasi dengan indah."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_27
msgid ""
"<b>Prime Location:</b> Situated in one of Brussels' most sought-after "
"residential districts."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lokasi Unggulan:</b> Terletak di salah satu kawasan perumahan paling "
"diminati di Brussel."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Pro Tip:</b> You can create a new rental contract directly from this view "
"by clicking on an empty slot in\n"
"                    the timeline."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pro Tip:</b> Anda dapat membuat kontrak sewa baru langsung dari tampilan "
"ini dengan mengeklik slot kosong di\n"
"                    timeline."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Properties App: </b>Organize your portfolio with a dedicated app to "
"manage property listings, contracts, and\n"
"                availability status."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Properti: </b>Atur portofolio Anda dengan aplikasi khusus untuk "
"mengelola daftar properti, kontrak, dan\n"
"                status ketersediaan."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sales App: </b>Handle offers, negotiations, and closing deals with "
"professional quotations and digital\n"
"                signatures."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Sales: </b>Tangani penawaran, negosiasi, dan penutupan "
"kesepakatan dengan surat penawaran profesional\n"
"                dan tanda tangan digital."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Select the Property:</b> Select the \"Property\" to rent."
msgstr "<b>Pilih Properti:</b> Pilih \"Properti\" yang akan disewakan."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sign App:</b> Send lease agreements for legally binding electronic "
"signatures."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Tanda Tangan:</b> Kirim perjanjian sewa-menyewa untuk tanda "
"tangan elektronik yang mengikat secara hukum."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_27
msgid "<b>Sky-High Sophistication in Uccle</b>"
msgstr "<b>Kemewahan Kelas Atas di Uccle</b>"

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Subscriptions App: </b>Automate the collection of recurring rent and "
"service charges with flexible billing\n"
"                cycles, ensuring consistent cash flow and effortless lease "
"renewals."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Langganan: </b>Otomatiskan penagihan sewa dan biaya layanan "
"berulang dengan siklus penagihan yang fleksibel\n"
"                untuk memastikan arus kas yang konsisten dan perpanjangan "
"sewa yang praktis."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_23
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_24
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_25
msgid "<b>The Future of Work in the Heart of Brussels</b>"
msgstr "<b>Masa Depan Dunia Kerja di Jantung Kota Brussel</b>"

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timeline:</b> Specify the start date, the recurring period (monthly, "
"quarterly, etc.) and the expiration of\n"
"                the contract."
msgstr ""
"<b>Timeline:</b> Tentukan tanggal mulai, periode berulang (bulanan, "
"triwulanan, dll.), dan masa berlaku\n"
"                kontrak."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_20
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_21
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_22
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:industry_real_estate.product_template_prop_26
msgid ""
"<b>Versatile Layouts:</b> From cozy 1-bedroom setups to more expansive open-"
"plan living areas."
msgstr ""
"<b>Layout Fleksibel:</b> Dari pengaturan 1 kamar tidur yang nyaman hingga "
"ruang tamu terbuka yang lebih luas."

#. module: industry_real_estate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_real_estate.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Website App: </b>Drive qualified traffic by promoting your listings on a "
"beautiful, mobile-responsive\n"
"                property management portal."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Website: </b>Tingkatkan traffic berkualitas dengan mempromosikan "
"daftar properti Anda di portal properti yang indah dan responsif\n"
"                 untuk perangkat seluler."

